{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_59_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_59","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_59_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_59","textTraditional":"三十年春王正月。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_59_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_59","textTraditional":"夏，次于成。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_59_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_59","textTraditional":"秋七月，齊人降鄣。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_59_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_59","textTraditional":"八月癸亥，葬紀叔姬。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_59_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_59","textTraditional":"九月庚午朔，日有食之，鼓、用牲于社。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_59_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_59","textTraditional":"冬，公及齊侯遇于魯濟。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_59_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_59","textTraditional":"齊人伐山戎。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_59_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_59","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_59_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_59","textTraditional":"三十年春，王命虢公討樊皮。夏四月丙辰，虢公入樊，執樊仲皮，歸于京師。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_59_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_59","textTraditional":"楚公子元歸自伐鄭，而處王宮，鬬射師諫，則執而梏之。秋，申公鬬班殺子元，鬬穀於菟為令尹，自毀其家，以紓楚國之難。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_59_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_59","textTraditional":"冬，遇于魯濟，謀山戎也，以其病燕故也。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}